        "feature_card_b7y7pV": {
          "type": "feature_card",
          "settings": {
            "feature_card_heading": "",
            "feature_card_text": "<p>Where can I shop Viburnum Home?</p>",
            "feature_card_url": "",
            "feature_card_button_text": ""
          }
        },
        "read_more_text_C7cHnp": {
          "type": "read_more_text",
          "settings": {
            "read_more_text_description": "<p>You can shop online, by email, or in-store at one of  our locations: Princeton, NJ or Summit, NJ.</p>"
          }
        },
        "feature_card_y8QyX7": {
          "type": "feature_card",
          "settings": {
            "feature_card_heading": "",
            "feature_card_text": "<p>Can I bring my clients into your studio to see the products in person?</p>",
            "feature_card_url": "",
            "feature_card_button_text": ""
          }
        },
        "read_more_text_VGaVaL": {
          "type": "read_more_text",
          "settings": {
            "read_more_text_description": "<p>The items you see in the Viburnum Home store are often custom made once an order is placed. We cannot guarantee that we will have samples of the same products in our studio locations however, we often have similar designs and products for examples. If you are looking to see something specific we would suggest reaching out to us directly by phone to check our studio availability before coming in. Bringing a client into one of our studios will be of great help to understand our capabilities for custom designs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "feature_card_PftBK9": {
          "type": "feature_card",
          "settings": {
            "feature_card_heading": "",
            "feature_card_text": "<p>Do you charge sales tax?</p>",
            "feature_card_url": "",
            "feature_card_button_text": ""
          }
        },
        "read_more_text_8dfD4H": {
          "type": "read_more_text",
          "settings": {
            "read_more_text_description": "<p>Viburnum & Co. is required to collect sales tax based on the laws and regulations of the state or province indicated in the shipping address. As tax regulations continue to evolve, we will continue to monitor state and local tax laws to ensure compliance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "feature_card_KTNDLa": {
          "type": "feature_card",
          "settings": {
            "feature_card_heading": "",
            "feature_card_text": "<p>Do I qualify for Viburnum & Co. Trade Program?</p>",
            "feature_card_url": "",
            "feature_card_button_text": ""
          }
        },
        "read_more_text_EqNBgd": {
          "type": "read_more_text",
          "settings": {
            "read_more_text_description": "<p>Interior designers working on commercial or residential projects with a valid resale license or other professional certification often qualify for the Viburnum Home Trade Program. Applicants must provide their valid tax ID & a portfolio of their work in order to be approved. [Portfolio of work can be submitted in the form of social media account, PDF, jpeg, or storefront location/information]</p>"
          }
        },
        "feature_card_MnNm3E": {
          "type": "feature_card",
          "settings": {
            "feature_card_heading": "",
            "feature_card_text": "<p>Do you offer home styling or interior decor consultation?</p>",
