            "read_more_text_description": "<p>We offer a 24-hour grace period for order cancellations as long as your order has not shipped. Should you wish to cancel your order, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@viburnumhome.com\">info@viburnumhome.com</a> or call us at 908 6798855within 24 hours for assistance.</p>"
